WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Trainer: This is how we handle
a price objection.

2
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.700
Customer: Your IT support costs
more than our other quote.

3
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:12.760
Trainer: Does that quote include
onsite visits or remote support only?

4
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.880
Customer: Remote only.

5
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.380
Trainer: Then let's compare
our remote plan first.

6
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.840
If you need someone onsite,

7
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.420
I'll explain exactly
when visits are included.

8
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.720
Clarify the need
before defending the price.
